# Day 8 – ThinkerCAD Practice 🔥  
# Smart Door Lock System using Arduino UNO, Keypad, Servo Motor, NPN Transistor, and Diode

## 📌 Project Overview
This project is a password-based smart door lock system developed in ThinkerCAD using Arduino UNO.  
The system allows secure access through a 4×4 keypad. When the correct password is entered, the servo motor rotates to simulate door unlocking. If an incorrect password is entered, the buzzer and red LED are activated as an alert system.

This project was created as part of my Day 8 ThinkerCAD embedded systems practice to improve both programming and practical electronics knowledge.

